      "side": 1,
      "message": "FFA_RXTX_MAP does not define the same return codes as FFA_VM_CREATION_MSG so we should not expect the caller of FFA_RXTX_MAP to handle the retry cases that FFA_VM_CREATION_MSG. Also FFA_VM_CREATION_MSG should be sent before the VM is visible to the SP that requested this message. We could inject a check for this into every ff-a call from the guest that might reach the SP, but it seems simpler to send this when the host tries to create the VM.",
